<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?>
<kml xmlns="http://www.opengis.net/kml/2.2"><Document><name>Arnhem Guide: 12 places – Hoge Veluwe, the Bridge at Arnhem &amp; hidden gems – HiddenGem.Atlas</name><description>https://noelsprick-alt.github.io/HiddenGem.Atlas/en/guide/arnhem/</description><Style id="must"><IconStyle><color>ff4cd8ff</color><Icon><href>https://maps.google.com/mapfiles/kml/paddle/wht-blank.png</href></Icon></IconStyle></Style><Style id="gem"><IconStyle><color>ffd0569b</color><Icon><href>https://maps.google.com/mapfiles/kml/paddle/wht-blank.png</href></Icon></IconStyle></Style><Placemark><name>1. Hoge Veluwe National Park on the white bikes</name><styleUrl>#must</styleUrl><description>Must-see · Come early, take a bike and ride to the furthest target first – it gets busier in the afternoon. · https://noelsprick-alt.github.io/HiddenGem.Atlas/en/guide/arnhem/#o1</description><Point><coordinates>5.83108,52.07971,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>2. The Bridge at Arnhem</name><styleUrl>#must</styleUrl><description>Must-see · 🆓 Free to experience · https://noelsprick-alt.github.io/HiddenGem.Atlas/en/guide/arnhem/#o2</description><Point><coordinates>5.91163,51.97482,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>3. Kröller-Müller Museum &amp; sculpture garden</name><styleUrl>#must</styleUrl><description>Must-see · Go to the sculpture garden after the museum if you still have energy – it is especially lovely in sun. · https://noelsprick-alt.github.io/HiddenGem.Atlas/en/guide/arnhem/#o3</description><Point><coordinates>5.81783,52.09591,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>4. Airborne Museum Hartenstein &amp; Oosterbeek cemetery</name><styleUrl>#must</styleUrl><description>Must-see · Plan the visit before the bridge – then you see the place with different eyes. · https://noelsprick-alt.github.io/HiddenGem.Atlas/en/guide/arnhem/#o4</description><Point><coordinates>5.83269,51.98771,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>5. Eusebius Church &amp; old town</name><styleUrl>#must</styleUrl><description>Must-see · 🆓 Free to experience · The tower is not always open – check times beforehand and plan it for good weather. · https://noelsprick-alt.github.io/HiddenGem.Atlas/en/guide/arnhem/#o5</description><Point><coordinates>5.91135,51.97867,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>6. Netherlands Open Air Museum</name><styleUrl>#must</styleUrl><description>Must-see · Perfect for rainy days and families – plan three to four hours. · https://noelsprick-alt.github.io/HiddenGem.Atlas/en/guide/arnhem/#o6</description><Point><coordinates>5.91071,52.01065,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>7. Burgers' Zoo</name><styleUrl>#must</styleUrl><description>Must-see · Come in the morning when the animals are more active and it is quieter. · https://noelsprick-alt.github.io/HiddenGem.Atlas/en/guide/arnhem/#o7</description><Point><coordinates>5.9006,52.00999,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>8. Sonsbeek Park</name><styleUrl>#must</styleUrl><description>Must-see · 🆓 Free to experience · Pack a picnic and sit by one of the ponds. · https://noelsprick-alt.github.io/HiddenGem.Atlas/en/guide/arnhem/#o8</description><Point><coordinates>5.90381,51.99132,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>9. Hunting lodge Sint Hubertus &amp; the deer rut</name><styleUrl>#gem</styleUrl><description>Hidden gem · Go early or in the evening in autumn – then the chances of roaring stags are best. · https://noelsprick-alt.github.io/HiddenGem.Atlas/en/guide/arnhem/#o9</description><Point><coordinates>5.83283,52.12155,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>10. Klarendal – Arnhem’s fashion district</name><styleUrl>#gem</styleUrl><description>Hidden gem · 🆓 Free to experience · Come in the afternoon and on a day when shops are open – not on Monday. · https://noelsprick-alt.github.io/HiddenGem.Atlas/en/guide/arnhem/#o10</description><Point><coordinates>5.9233,51.99001,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark><Placemark><name>11. Posbank &amp; Veluwezoom – heath with a view</name><styleUrl>#gem</styleUrl><description>Hidden gem · Come for the heather bloom in August/September – best in the early morning. · https://noelsprick-alt.github.io/HiddenGem.Atlas/en/guide/arnhem/#o11</description><Point><coordinates>6.02179,52.02853,0</coordinates></Point></Placemark></Document></kml>
